    "body": "fix on issue/812-lenient-fixture-keys (stacked on #809) · PR #830 · pinned by fixture_keys_lenient::{unknown_or_malformed_fixture_keys_are_dropped_with_a_note_and_the_load_goes_on, a_law_breaking_accessory_key_is_noted_too, a_stud_wider_than_its_strap_is_refused_by_name}, ui fixture_accessory_tests::the_fit_says_it_sinks_the_vise_and_holds_the_height · merges when reviewed (after #809). Left for their own PR: the #811 review items (dovetail lip hint, Centre on stock action, CENTRE_TOL). #811's self_centering key rides inside ViseDto, so it inherits the lenient read; it adjusts to the unchecked ViseDto::to_params when it merges main.",
